{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港鐵表示，由於藍田站月台有設備冒煙，現時觀塘綫列車不停藍田站，港鐵及消防人員正在現場處理。現時藍田站沒有列車服務，藍田站暫時關閉。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港鐵正安排免費接駁巴士，行駛觀塘至油塘站，呼籲請乘客為行程預留充裕時間。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:02.054171+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T01:04:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:00.708747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:00.708747+00:00","content_hash":"1e41bcf8fc9b6f2b8e8ce1c3da3898618f9ed65f1977be2142f08c37b3945092","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}